</p>
<dl><dd>BOOL bWasLooted = ((ItemMoveOptions::cm_OptionFlags &amp; ITEM_MOVE_LOOTED_BY_PLAYER)&#160;!= 0&#160;? TRUE&#160;: FALSE);</dd>
<dd>pScriptEvent-&gt;SetBool(0, bWasLooted);</dd></dl>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>This documentation seems to be wrong. When an item is removed from a placeable, both the event creator and target are the placeable, not the new owner. 
</p><p>One method of determining who has removed the object is to store the event creator in a local object variable when the placable is opened in EVENT_TYPE_USE.
</p>
